printing.color_note = Pixel ko rej ukot ñan sRGB. Kein lale PDF im printer eo am rej lale profile in kōļar an printer eo.
printing.sizing_note = Mode in kobaik pija ilo cell ej kōṃṃan pija eo en delọñ ilo cell, im ej kōjparok joñan aitok im depakpak an, im ejjab kōṃōttan e. Joñan eo ekkar ej kōjerbal DPI in document; kadikdik oran row ak column ko ñe ejjab delọñ. Print PDF eo ilo 100%, im kabōjrak fit-to-page ilo kein lale PDF.
printing.running = Ej kōṃṃan PDF…
printing.save_pdf = Kōjparok PDF…
printing.open_print = Kōjparok im bellọk PDF eo ñan print…
printing.invalid = Joñan pija ak wāween kōṃṃan print eo ejjab jejjet.
printing.limit = Jerbal in print in elap jān joñan eo melim: 200 pija, 40 million pixel ilo juon pija ak 32768 pixel ilo kajjojo turin pija, ak 256 MiB in data in PDF eṃōj kōdikdik e.
printing.profile_error = Profile in kōļar an pija in ejjab jejjet, ejjab ekkar ak ejjab maroñ jerbal. Channel in kōļar CMYK/Lab ilo document eo make ej aikuj profile eo ejimwe eṃōj likūt ilo document; RGB ej aikuj profile in RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Pija eo ilo DPI in document eo ejjab delọñ ilo cell in. Kōjerbal mode in kobaik pija, grid eo ewōr row ak column ko redikļọk, ak peba eo eļapļọk.
printing.caption_limit = Naan kōn pija eo eaitokļọk ñan grid in. Kadikdik row ak column ko, kadikdik naan ko ak kabōjrak naan kōn pija ko.
printing.font_error = Ejelọk font ñan naan kōn pija eo. Install juon font in text ak kabōjrak naan kōn pija ko.
printing.no_document = Bellọk juon document ak kālet pija ko ilo gallery mokta jān print.
printing.source_error = Ejjab maroñ riit pija eṃōj kālet, file in ukot eo ej pād iturin pija, ak naan kōn pija. Ejelọk PDF eṃōj kōjparok.
printing.save_error = Ejjab maroñ kōjparok PDF eo. Kālet etan file ekāāl ilo folder eo kwōmaroñ jeje iloan; file ko rej pād rejjab maroñ ukot kōn bar file ilo jabdewōt iien.
printing.downloaded = Eṃōj download PDF eo. Bellọk ilo kein lale PDF ñan print ilo 100%.
printing.saved = Eṃōj kōjparok PDF: {path}
